\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2.1}{\ignorespaces Process overview of RAP generation before rover departures}}{8}{figure.caption.12}%
\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2.2}{\ignorespaces SayCan combining language-model relevance scores with value-function affordance scores to select the next skill, reproduced from Ahn et al.~\cite {ahn2022saycan}.}}{9}{figure.caption.13}%
\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2.3}{\ignorespaces The KnowNo pipeline: an LLM planner proposes next steps with confidence scores, conformal prediction narrows these to a calibrated prediction set, and the rover asks for help whenever that set contains more than one option. Reproduced from \citet {ren2023knowno}.}}{11}{figure.caption.14}%
\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2.4}{\ignorespaces The introspective planning pipeline: a knowledge base of explained past examples is built offline, and at deployment the most similar example is retrieved to inform the LLM's confidence for each candidate step. Reproduced from \citet {liang2024introspective}.}}{13}{figure.caption.15}%
